# Step 2 - Feature Engineering Artifacts

This directory contains supporting outputs generated during the feature engineering stage of the IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection project.

The original generated artifacts, including the engineered training dataset (`fe_train_full.parquet`), are stored separately on Google Drive due to their storage requirements.

The files can be accessed through the project's Google Drive directory:

`IEEE_CIS_Project/artifacts/artifacts_step2_fe/`

These artifacts are generated by the feature engineering stage of the main notebook.
